      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Viola_Delaware",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the late 19th and early 20th centuries, Viola supported a lumberyard, sawmill, and a husk factory that turned corn husks into mattresses.",
